# RaceDay API Endpoint Plan

## 1. Introduction

The RaceDay system will use a RESTful Web API to facilitate communication between the application and the database. The API provides endpoints for user authentication, profile management, event management, categories, participant enrolments, results, routes and weather information. HTTP methods are used according to the purpose of each operation, while role-based access is applied to protect functions that require organiser or participant privileges.

## 2. Authentication and User Management

| HTTP Method | Route                | Description                                                            | Role Required      | Request Body                                            | Expected Response |
| ----------- | -------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------- |
| POST        | `/api/auth/register` | Registers a new user on the RaceDay system.                            | Public             | FirstName, LastName, Email, Password, Role, PhoneNumber | 201 Created       |
| POST        | `/api/auth/login`    | Authenticates an existing user.                                        | Public             | Email, Password                                         | 200 OK            |
| GET         | `/api/users/profile` | Retrieves the profile information of the currently authenticated user. | Authenticated User | None                                                    | 200 OK            |
| PUT         | `/api/users/profile` | Updates the profile information of the authenticated user.             | Authenticated User | FirstName, LastName, PhoneNumber                        | 200 OK            |

## 3. Event Management

| HTTP Method | Route              | Description                                 | Role Required | Request Body                                                              | Expected Response |
| ----------- | ------------------ | ------------------------------------------- | ------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------- |
| GET         | `/api/events`      | Retrieves all available events.             | Public        | None                                                                      | 200 OK            |
| GET         | `/api/events/{id}` | Retrieves information for a specific event. | Public        | None                                                                      | 200 OK            |
| POST        | `/api/events`      | Creates a new sporting event.               | Organiser     | EventName, Description, EventDate, Location, RegistrationDeadline, Status | 201 Created       |
| PUT         | `/api/events/{id}` | Updates an existing event.                  | Organiser     | EventName, Description, EventDate, Location, RegistrationDeadline, Status | 200 OK            |
| DELETE      | `/api/events/{id}` | Removes an existing event.                  | Organiser     | None                                                                      | 204 No Content    |

